<page>
<notes>The case in which the largest codeword is z_{k+1}, a suffix of y. Deleting the first character c exposes the factorization w prime = y prime z_{k+1} z_k ... z_1. The suffix z_k ... z_1 is unchanged, y = c y prime z_{k+1}, and z_{k+1} &gt; z_k.</notes>
